Package: lightwrite
Version: 2.0.0
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Recommends: hunspell, hunspell-es, hunspell-en-us, libreoffice-writer
Maintainer: Magic City Reader <jr@magiccityreader.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/magiccityreader/Lightwrite
Description: Terminal-based word processor (Charm/Bubble Tea)
 Lightwrite is a minimalist word processor for the terminal, designed for
 creative writing. Version 2.0 is a Go rewrite using the Charm ecosystem
 (Bubble Tea, Lip Gloss, Bubbles).
 .
 It includes formatting (bold, italics, underline), heading levels with a
 chapter map, spell-checking via Hunspell, search and replace, and export
 options for RTF, TXT, DOCX, and PDF.
 .
 This package is the magiccityreader fork of Silvestre Parbut's Underwood,
 renamed Lightwrite.